---
import AcademicLayout from "../../layouts/AcademicLayout.astro";
---

<AcademicLayout title="Privacy by Construction" currentSection="about">
  <div class="container container-prose page-wrapper">
    <header class="page-header">
      <h1 class="page-title">Privacy by Construction</h1>
      <p class="page-lead">
        Symnoesis is engineered with zero telemetry, zero surveillance, and complete local execution.
      </p>
    </header>

    <article class="prose-content">
      <section>
        <h2>Architectural Guarantees</h2>
        <p>
          Unlike modern web services that harvest interaction telemetry, Symnoesis enforces strict client-side isolation:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Zero Tracking Scripts:</strong> This site uses no Google Analytics, PostHog, Mixpanel, or telemetry beacons.</li>
          <li><strong>No Third-Party CDNs:</strong> All fonts, scripts, stylesheets, and assets are self-hosted from this origin.</li>
          <li><strong>Local Edge Execution:</strong> The Interactive Map Portal runs entirely within your browser's JavaScript engine. When you take the self-assessment, not a single byte of your responses leaves your computer.</li>
          <li><strong>No Retention:</strong> No user database exists. We do not store, process, or sell any behavioral or interaction profiles.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Verification</h2>
        <p>
          You can verify these assertions by opening your browser's Network Inspector while navigating the site and using the portal. 
          Zero outbound HTTP requests are generated during interactive use.
        </p>
      </section>
    </article>
  </div>
</AcademicLayout>

<style>
  .page-wrapper { padding: 3rem 0; }
  .page-header { margin-bottom: 2.5rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); padding-bottom: 2rem; }
  .page-title { font-size: var(--text-h1); font-weight: 700; margin: 0.75rem 0 1rem 0; color: var(--ink); }
  .page-lead { font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--ink-2); line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; }
  .prose-content { font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: var(--text-body); line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ink); }
  .prose-content h2 { font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: var(--text-h2); font-weight: 600; margin: 2.5rem 0 1rem 0; color: var(--ink); }
  .prose-content p { margin: 0 0 1.25rem 0; }
  .prose-content ul { margin: 0 0 1.5rem 0; padding-left: 1.5rem; }
  .prose-content li { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
</style>
